class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Fire_Immunity.png/28px-Fire_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Fire_Immunity.png/42px-Fire_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Fire_Immunity.png/56px-Fire_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Fire_Immunity.png/28px-Fire_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Fire_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/42px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/56px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/42px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/56px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sturdy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><b>Sturdy</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>This material is rather strong. Only a hit that deals at least 10 damage can damage it.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\nThe <b>Grenade Impeller</b> is a device in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a> which fires a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concussion_Grenade\" title=\"Concussion Grenade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concussion_Grenade\" title=\"Concussion Grenade\">Concussion Grenade</a> at enemies that move in front of it. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The Grenade Impeller only become active during combat. After firing a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concussion_Grenade\" title=\"Concussion Grenade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concussion_Grenade\" title=\"Concussion Grenade\">Concussion Grenade</a>, it moves to a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Recharging_(Condition)\" title=\"Recharging (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharging\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Recharging_(Condition)\" title=\"Recharging (Condition)\">Recharging</a> status and is disabled for 1 turn.\n</p><p>Concussion Grenades gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quickly_Ticking_Mine_(Condition)\" title=\"Quickly Ticking Mine (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quickly Ticking Mine\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quickly_Ticking_Mine_(Condition)\" title=\"Quickly Ticking Mine (Condition)\">Quickly Ticking Mine</a> after being left on the ground for one turn. Picking up the grenade in this state results in it exploding in the owner's inventory at the start of the next turn.\n</p><p>Concussion Grenades gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Ballistics_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstable Ballistics (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstable Ballistics\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Ballistics_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstable Ballistics (Condition)\">Unstable Ballistics</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a>, preventing them from being picked up.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 326px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 324px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp/486px-Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp/730px-Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp/972px-Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp/486px-Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"324\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Jane-katsubo-grenade-impeller.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715000231\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.132 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.138 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5800/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50922/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19521/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11839/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1332630/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  129.562      1 -total\n 82.58%  106.997      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 57.97%   75.101      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 19.06%   24.695      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.02%   11.688      3 Template:Cond\n  8.41%   10.901     44 Template:Trim\n  8.07%   10.456      1 Template:Template_style\n  7.08%    9.170      2 Template:Item_icon\n  5.86%    7.591      4 Template:Icon_link\n  5.47%    7.081      4 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:38016-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715000231 and revision id 401521. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}